# 🧬 AETHERIA — HERO PERSISTENT DATA & ID BINDING SYSTEM

> **Every Hero has an identity.**
>
> Every change to that Hero becomes part of their history.
>
> Their Level, Stats, Skills, Star Rank, Traits, and development are permanently bound to their **Hero ID**.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

Hero Persistent Data System bertanggung jawab memastikan seluruh perkembangan Hero tersimpan secara permanen di Database System.

Setiap Hero memiliki:

```text
HERO ID
```

Contoh:

```text
HERO-000001
HERO-000002
HERO-000003
```

Semua data perkembangan akan terhubung langsung dengan ID tersebut.

```text
HERO ID
   │
   ├── Level
   ├── EXP
   ├── Star
   ├── Stats
   ├── Skills
   ├── Traits
   ├── Equipment
   ├── Emotional State
   ├── Growth History
   └── Skill History
```

---

